<title>JAPAN: Hankyu to issue 10 bln yen Euroyen CB.</title>
<headline>Hankyu to issue 10 bln yen Euroyen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Hankyu Corp</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Daiwa Europe</p>
<p> TYPE Euroyen convertible  ISSUE NO	    AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON			  ISSU PRICE	  MATURITY 30.Sep.06</p>
<p> CONV PRICE		    CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 29.Oct.96	 CONV TO 22.Sep.06</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S		  PAY DATE 22.Oct.96</p>
<p> FIRST INT PAY 31.Mar.97   INT PAY end-Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price have not been decided yet.</p>
